{"5078330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Glorpnauts", "steam_appid": 5078330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start small. Build bigger. Automate everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glorpnauts is a space incremental game where a small mining operation gradually grows into a busy automated network. Mine asteroids, generate Credits, refine resources, construct new structures, and fill the screen with ships working on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Living Space Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fleet and watch your operation come to life. Mining Ships gather resources, Trade Ships keep Credits flowing, Refineries process materials, and specialized structures help your economy become faster and increasingly automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn't just to make the numbers bigger — it's to <strong>watch the whole system grow with them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/2bdbc406417f88c26a27b2b47028bd9e.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/2bdbc406417f88c26a27b2b47028bd9e.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/2bdbc406417f88c26a27b2b47028bd9e.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect What You've Built</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth attracts attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirates can invade your territory and threaten your operation, forcing you to build defenses and deploy Combat Ships. Defeating them can reward you with <strong>Rare Resources</strong>, turning dangerous encounters into another path toward progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/1fe0441218012aa9d1622e1353fc5b30.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/1fe0441218012aa9d1622e1353fc5b30.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/1fe0441218012aa9d1622e1353fc5b30.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Reset. Upgrade. Grow Again.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your current operation reaches its limits, prestige lets you start again while keeping powerful permanent upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Rare Resources to expand your Skill Tree, improve future runs, unlock new possibilities, and turn every restart into a faster and more powerful version of the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc38a58fa215bb3f8f6d23862dee82c2.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc38a58fa215bb3f8f6d23862dee82c2.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc38a58fa215bb3f8f6d23862dee82c2.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There's Always More Out There</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually, your civilization can look beyond its current territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send expeditions into unexplored space, discover new Systems, and establish new bases as your operation expands farther into the galaxy.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/868f9ee4d9517ab3c0895ec7a65a116a.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/868f9ee4d9517ab3c0895ec7a65a116a.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/868f9ee4d9517ab3c0895ec7a65a116a.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep the Numbers Going Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More ships. More resources. More automation. More upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build something small and watch it become a ridiculously efficient space operation</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start small. Build bigger. Automate everything.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glorpnauts is a space incremental game where a small mining operation gradually grows into a busy automated network. Mine asteroids, generate Credits, refine resources, construct new structures, and fill the screen with ships working on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.webm?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/cc167ee8e4652ec6b5d74edec596cc15.mp4?t=1787849536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build a Living Space Economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fleet and watch your operation come to life. Mining Ships gather resources, Trade Ships keep Credits flowing, Refineries process materials, and specialized structures help your economy become faster and increasingly automated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal isn't just to make the numbers bigger — it's to <strong>watch the whole system grow with them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/2bdbc406417f88c26a27b2b47028bd9e.poster.avif?t=1787849536\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5078330/extras/2bdbc40641